    "summary": "For a **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** model. Once per battle, as your opponent's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, with the bearer on the battlefield, you may activate this Enhancement and spend up to 4 [YP](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency):\n\n1. Pick one of your **HERNKYN** units, plus up to one more for every 2YP spent.\n2. You may take the picked units off the battlefield and put them into **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**.\n\nA unit within **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of any enemy unit that is not assailed cannot be picked (see [Assailed From Every Angle](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.persecution-prospect.assailed-from-every-angle)).",
